cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "GloVe from Scratch: Word Embeddings Trained on WikiText-2"
abstract: "GloVe word embeddings built from first principles: sparse co-occurrence matrix (120x smaller than dense), hand-derived gradients verified against autograd, and manual AdaGrad, with no autograd or torch.optim. Trained on WikiText-2 in 26 s on a 4 GB laptop GPU, with analogy tests, ablations and a comparison against official GloVe vectors."
